      "item": "theoreticalsciences:multiverse_rift",
      "title": "Multiverse Rift Stabilizer",
      "text": "Holds open a tear into neighbouring universes and harvests what leaks through. I keep the lights low around it.$(br2)$(thing)Tier 5$() machine."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Note to self: this controller is too complex for a crafting grid. It has to be built on the $(item)Femtoscale Assembly Line$() - check JEI for the exact parts before ordering anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Harvest log. Each harvest pulls matter from universes whose physical constants differ slightly from ours, including $(item)Multiverse Shards$() and $(fluid)Inflaton Field$()."
    },
    {
      "type": "patchouli:text",
      "text": "Context: eternal inflation and the string landscape (perhaps 10^500 possible vacua) both suggest other universes with other constants. None is reachable in our physics. The $(item)Multiverse Rift Stabilizer$() disagrees."
    },
